Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.20,0:01:03.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《黑衣人》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:00.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的! 可恶的昆虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn bugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:22.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真倒霉! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.41,0:03:28.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,边界巡警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:43.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,衰人尼克 真想不到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Nick the Dick. What a surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.80,0:03:45.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你从哪儿来的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you coming from,Nick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.97,0:03:47.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我去柯里纳钓鱼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fishing in Cuernavaca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:50.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 看看你有什么鱼获{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure. Let's take a look at your catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:52.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:02.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把他们扔回去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would've thrown them back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:11.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你收多少钱? 每人一百? 二百? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you get? 100 bucks a head? 200?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.87,0:04:15.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你有储钱请律师! 你用的到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you saved it all for your lawyer. You'll need it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.17,0:04:21.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,交给我们处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:22.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.13,0:04:24.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,移民局第6区的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}INS, Division 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.67,0:04:27.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,移民局第6区? 没听说过第6区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Division 6? I never heard of Division 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.26,0:04:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.30,0:04:30.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你押在谁身上? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you betting on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:32.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很难说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough call, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.80,0:04:36.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 你好吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.31,0:04:37.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 好{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.60,0:04:40.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,婆婆 别担心{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:43.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到美国{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.81,0:04:45.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪? 诺克里斯?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:48.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想找工作啊?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.49,0:04:49.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢 也是吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.32,0:04:51.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也是?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.11,0:04:53.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴在这儿见到你{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:55.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.70,0:04:59.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我可砸你的脸吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.62,0:05:03.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你长得真丑 不是吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你连一句西班牙话都不明白{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:10.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've got a winner here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.67,0:05:12.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:14.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人都可以走了{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.97,0:05:16.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.72,0:05:18.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,上车走吧{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 你不能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, you can't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.27,0:05:21.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别叫我先生 年轻人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't "sir" me, young man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:24.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不知道你在跟谁打交道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no idea who you're dealing with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:29.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在立刻上车!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.86,0:05:33.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们要跟我们的朋友谈谈 你们先走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll chat with our friend. You hit the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:38.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续保护我们 不受危险的外来者的骚扰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep on protecting us from the dangerous aliens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.75,0:05:44.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听过第6区吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever hear of Division 6?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:46.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,根本没有第6区{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no Division 6.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.92,0:05:48.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这根本在胡说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:49.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:54.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你在不该在的地方 从巴士上掉下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you fell off the bus in the wrong part of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.26,0:05:57.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我打赌你一定不是这附近的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll bet you're not from anywhere near here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.06,0:06:02.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,米奇? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.65,0:06:11.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,米奇 你什么时候出狱的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mikey, when they let you out of jail?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.24,0:06:14.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,政治犯 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Political refugee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:17.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可知你犯了多少条约? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how many treaties you just violated?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 1条? - 是7条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- One? - Try seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:24.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把那头给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hand me that head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.42,0:06:31.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把你的手和蹼举起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put up your arms and flippers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.93,0:06:44.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.31,0:06:50.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:22.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那个 - 那个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "That." - That...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:28.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是人类 没错 你身上还挂着些内脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was not human. I know. You got some entrails on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.31,0:07:31.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:33.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切都在控制中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The situation's under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请留意一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your attention for a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:37.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我乐意将事情对你们说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.45,0:07:51.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这称为记忆清除器 是远方友人送的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is called a neuralizer. It's a gift from friends from out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:53.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,红光能隔离...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This red eye isolates...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:56.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...脑中电子脉冲 尤其是记忆脉冲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the brain's impulses, specifically the ones for memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,从这开始...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a splay burn on the perimeter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:01.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...将方圆80公尺范围内...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with holes at 40, 60, and 80 metres...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.01,0:08:04.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...不规则的烧焦 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...from right here. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.73,0:08:10.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.31,0:08:12.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么回事? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.52,0:08:17.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,答案就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer you're looking for lies right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.24,0:08:22.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁 到底是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.32,0:08:23.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.24,0:08:27.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你想像中的一个虚构人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am just a figment of your imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:33.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,妈的 真是好骗的品种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, what a gullible breed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:38.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的 你们没被炸死真侥幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious. You're lucky to be alive after that blast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.67,0:08:39.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么爆炸? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What blast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地下煤气管 天才{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The underground gas main.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.51,0:08:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开枪前应注意点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should exercise caution before firing...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在告诉你 尤其是你! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'll tell you that now. Especially you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:50.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你离开前先到 急诊室检查一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have yourself checked out with EMS before you leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:05.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才很抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:06.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总是会有意外的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.04,0:09:08.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以前不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't used to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:12.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的心有余 K 但是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spirit's willing, Kay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.25,0:09:16.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...其他的部分...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but the rest of me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.96,0:09:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们真漂亮 不是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're beautiful, aren't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:23.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些星辰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.39,0:09:26.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不只是光看星星了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We never just look anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:30.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.06,0:09:33.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 我告诉你...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you, Kay...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.60,0:09:36.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我会怀念追逐的日子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I will miss the chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.07,0:09:42.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 D...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Dee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.12,0:09:48.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.79,0:09:50.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是纽约警察 别动! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}NYPD! Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.41,0:09:53.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,交给你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All yours, Edwards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.75,0:09:57.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动就是站住! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze means stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.97,0:10:05.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么回事? ! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:16.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在纽约会下黑人雨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just be raining black people in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.00,0:10:43.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.80,0:10:45.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纽-约-警-察! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}N-Y-P-D!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.97,0:10:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这代表了我会扭送你进警察局! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Means I will knock your punk-ass down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.80,0:10:50.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要来了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:53.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他来了之后 我亦会拘捕他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and when he gets here, I'll arrest his ass too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.06,0:10:59.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想被打? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You trying to catch a beat-down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.76,0:12:07.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:10.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在路上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.22,0:12:14.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他来是因为我失败了 他亦会杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's coming because I failed. Now he'll kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.26,0:12:16.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天得罪了不少人 不是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You pissing everybody off today, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:20.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.31,0:12:22.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的世界就快被毁灭了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your world's gonna end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.57,0:12:26.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是什么东西? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.74,0:12:35.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当心会掉下去 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch that ledge. Watch the ledge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.28,0:12:38.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下来 我们能把眼晴医好的 别担心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on down. We'll get those eyes fixed, don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:41.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 让我跟你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Let me talk to you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.63,0:12:50.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我累得半死才可以为生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work my butt off to make a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:54.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只希望能回到一个整洁的家 有顿丰盛的晚餐...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I want is to come home to a fat steak on the table...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.47,0:12:56.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但我却得到这些 看起来像毒药{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but instead I get this. It looks like poison.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.10,0:13:01.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别拿走! 我正在吃呢! 这是毒药 不是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't take that away! I'm eating that! It is poison, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.48,0:13:04.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果 我一点都不会惊讶...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, I wouldn't be surprised if it was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.31,0:13:06.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你像一只被打太多或打的 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the way you skulk like a dog been hit too much,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:07.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不够的狗一样的闪闪躲躲!{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}or not enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:09.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:11.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一点用都没有 碧姿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're useless, Beatrice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.53,0:13:15.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这唯一可以做点事的东西 就是我的卡车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing that pulls its weight around here is my goddamn truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:27.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,早料到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Figures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.35,0:13:37.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么鬼玩意儿? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the heck is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:41.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你滚进屋里去! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your big butt back in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.90,0:13:57.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请把发射武器放在地上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place projectile weapon on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.53,0:13:59.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要我丢下枪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can have my gun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.45,0:14:01.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...除非我死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...when you pry it from my dead fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:04.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我接受你的建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your proposal is acceptable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.54,0:14:48.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,雅加 到底是怎么回事? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Edgar, what on earth was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:49.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.09,0:14:52.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过糖会搞成那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen sugar do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.59,0:14:55.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把糖给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me sugar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:01.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放在水里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.23,0:15:09.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}More.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:30.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的皮快掉下来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your skin is hanging off your bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:43.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样好些吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that better?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"那罪犯眨了两对眼睑"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The perpetrator blinked two sets of eyelids."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:17.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你指两眼一起眨? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blinked with both eyes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:20.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他先眨一对 然后再眨另外一对完全不同的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He blinked one set, then a completely different set.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.13,0:16:23.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像高灯和低灯那样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, like high beams and low beams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:28.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在你说的那个武器...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that before or after he drew the weapon that you claim...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.85,0:16:30.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...蒸发成百万片...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...evaporated into a million pieces?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.23,0:16:32.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}After, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.73,0:16:37.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何都没有别的警官 看见这些事件? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is it that no other officers saw either of these events?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.69,0:16:40.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,部分警察的腰围发胖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of them are soggy around the midsection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.53,0:16:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是他们赶不上的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They weren't able to keep up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:44.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你是半个男人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you were half the man I am...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.70,0:16:47.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是你一半那么胖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am half the man that you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.41,0:16:49.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你有什么问题? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.29,0:16:50.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你缠住我了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in my face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:53.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我想他把他从屋顶上丢下去 - 真的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I think he threw him off the roof. - You next.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:54.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.63,0:16:57.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,10分钟 祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes, you take your best shot, tough guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.25,0:17:01.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,先运动10分钟 肥仔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take 10 minutes on a StairMaster, you pudgy bastard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:09.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你 我是验尸官韦娜璐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you. Laurel Weaver. Deputy Medical Examiner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.93,0:17:12.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到验尸房找我 我有证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find me at the morgue. I'll show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.23,0:17:13.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.39,0:17:14.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:19.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是检验无名尸的韦医生? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Dr. Weaver with the coroner's office working on the John Doe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.82,0:17:22.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是的 - 请看这里 好吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's right. - Will you look at this, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.58,0:17:31.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚真精彩 不是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some night, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.37,0:17:32.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚真精彩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.41,0:17:34.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们是腮 不是眼睑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were gills, not eyelids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:37.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,腮 他在喘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gills. He was out of breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:39.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:41.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟你说了什么吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说世界末日到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said the world was coming to an end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.93,0:17:46.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他有说什么时候吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say when?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:55.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再看到那武器你会认出吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you recognize his weapon if you saw it again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.39,0:17:56.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:00.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走 我们去兜风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's take a ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢着 我有一堆报告要写{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. Look, I got tons of paperwork...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.32,0:18:04.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都写好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.45,0:18:05.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:08.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的是徒步去追那衰人? 不简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really ran this dude down on foot? That's tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,非常不简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's double tough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.21,0:18:20.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是哪个部门的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who exactly are you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.63,0:18:22.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底是哪个部门的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So who exactly are you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.67,0:18:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,调查局? 国安局? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}FBI? NSA?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.09,0:18:29.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们负责监控地球上的外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm part of a bureau that licenses, monitors and polices aliens on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.89,0:18:31.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随便啦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.39,0:18:32.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:36.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我们要去的地方? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where we're going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.06,0:18:38.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是积克的店{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Jack Jeebs' spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他卖赃物但是不卖枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He buys from chain-snatchers. Doesn't sell guns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.27,0:18:42.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:43.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.11,0:18:48.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我进去问他几个问题 出来时我要你说实话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go in and put my thing down, but when I come out, I want answers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.49,0:18:50.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进去问他几个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, go put your thing down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,爱德华警官...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer Eduardo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.92,0:19:00.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这怎么会在这? 我以为已经交给当局了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did these get here? I thought I turned them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:04.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听说你有比偷来的劳力士更抢手的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you're into something hotter than stolen Rolexes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.55,0:19:07.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也贩卖毒品 但我喜欢在这儿做生意的时间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I deal crack, but I still work here. I love the hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.76,0:19:10.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我指的是枪 耍聪明! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking about guns, smart-ass! Weird ones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:14.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你眼见的 我只有这么些货了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! What you see is what I got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他看进口货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show him the imports, Jeebs.{\r}
