Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.77,0:27:42.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但是他只是在运动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but he's just working out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.65,0:27:46.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我在运动时 被逮捕会是什么滋味? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd I feel if somebody bust my ass while I'm on the treadmill?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:48.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后我看到这个在嘶叫的怪物...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I saw this snarling beast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.69,0:27:51.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...因为看到他手里拿了卫生纸 所以我知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed he had a tissue in his hand and realized...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.99,0:27:54.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...他在打喷嚏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...he's not snarling, he's sneezing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.28,0:27:55.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那不造成威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ain't no threat there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.87,0:27:56.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到蒂芬妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I saw Tiffany.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.20,0:28:00.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 一个8岁白人的女孩 半夜在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}8-year-old white girl, middle of the ghetto...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.37,0:28:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...全是怪物的街上 手上拿着量子学书...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...bunch of monsters at night with quantum physics books?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.50,0:28:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...她一定有些不好的企图{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She about to start some shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.50,0:28:08.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这种书对她来说太深了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those books are way too advanced for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.30,0:28:10.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我而言 她很可疑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you ask me, she's up to something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.97,0:28:13.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老实说 关于这点 我觉得你不要这么针对我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd appreciate it if you eased up about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.85,0:28:19.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还是要我向她道歉? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or do I owe her an apology?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.48,0:28:28.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,至少射得很准 不是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good shot, though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.45,0:28:36.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不好管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has a problem with authority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.62,0:28:37.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.20,0:28:41.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他能徒步追捕塞波人 老大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this kid ran down a cephalopoid on foot, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.62,0:28:43.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那要很强悍才行的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's gotta be tough enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.58,0:28:46.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望你知道自己做什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's hope you know what you're doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.22,0:28:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen, congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.60,0:29:01.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...恭喜 多年的政府训练没有白费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're everything we expect from years of government training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.35,0:29:04.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位跟我来 最后一项 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll just follow me, we have one more test to administer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.19,0:29:06.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是视力测验{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}An eye exam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.78,0:29:21.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.91,0:29:24.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,究竟什么回事? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.66,0:29:27.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在1950年左右 政府成立了经费不足的机构...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the 1950s, the government started an underfunded agency...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.04,0:29:30.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...简单而好笑的目的只是要 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with the laughable purpose of establishing contact...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.00,0:29:32.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与外星人取得联系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with a race not of this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.01,0:29:35.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位看这仪器末端{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at the end of this device.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.51,0:29:38.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,除了外星人之外 人类都把这当成笑话...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone thought the agency was a joke, except the aliens...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.68,0:29:41.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但在1961年时 外星人在纽约有首次的接触{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...who made contact on March 2, 1961 outside New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.01,0:29:43.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一天晚我们有九个人 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were nine of us the first night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.72,0:29:46.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,七名特工 一名天文家...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} Seven agents, one astronomer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.27,0:29:48.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...及一个迷途的男孩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and a dumb kid who'd gotten lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.69,0:29:51.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 你给那个高个子献花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You brought that tall man some flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.15,0:29:53.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.44,0:29:56.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是一群银河系的难民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were a group of intergalactic refugees.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.03,0:30:00.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想把地球当做无家可归者 的政治庇护所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanted Earth as an apolitical zone for creatures without a planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.91,0:30:02.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看过《北非谍影》吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever see Casablanca?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.70,0:30:04.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是一样的 只是没有纳粹党{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same thing, except no Nazis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.58,0:30:07.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们同意 而且藏匿了他们降落的证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We agreed and concealed all evidence of their landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.88,0:30:13.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以这些是真的飞碟 世界博览会只是个掩饰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So these are real flying saucers and the World's Fair was a cover-up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.30,0:30:14.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有什么其他理由在皇后区? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why hold it in Queens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.67,0:30:17.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,每年到达的非人类越来越多而且 隐藏在我们之中生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}More nonhumans arrive every year and live among us in secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.84,0:30:19.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是要改变话题 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to change the subject,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.55,0:30:22.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最后一次做脑电图是什么时候?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}but when was the last time you got a CAT scan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.85,0:30:26.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 半年前 是公司规定的 - 你该做另一个预约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Six months ago. It's company policy. - Make another appointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.77,0:30:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉Z我玩得很高兴...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your boy Zed I had an absolutely wonderful time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.23,0:30:33.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...而且要谢谢你 并请告诉我出口在哪儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and thank you for everything, but show me the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:36.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要喝咖啡 你要吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. I'm getting some coffee. You want some?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.86,0:30:38.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不要了 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们好吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.33,0:30:46.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 K{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.71,0:30:50.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那是不是没咖啡因的? - 是维尼斯肉桂味{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's not decaf, is it? - Viennese cinnamon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.62,0:30:54.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉我只有粉末的奶精了 我最不喜欢那种了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me we only got powdered stuff for cream. I hate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.51,0:30:58.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's good. Good. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.59,0:31:01.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们相处的愉快吧? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys getting along all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.93,0:31:04.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,工作别太辛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't work too hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.27,0:31:10.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不要咖啡? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure you don't want some coffee?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.73,0:31:18.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事情是这样的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.49,0:31:21.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地球上约有一千五百名外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}At any given time, there are around 1500 aliens on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.07,0:31:24.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分居住在曼哈顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of them here in Manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.28,0:31:27.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大部分守规矩 只想谋生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of them are decent. Just trying to make a living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:29.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 计程车司机? - 不是你所想像的那么多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cab drivers? - Not as many as you'd think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.37,0:31:33.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大多数的人类一点也不知道 也不想知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humans, for the most part, don't have a clue. Don't want one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.75,0:31:38.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们很高兴 以为自己掌握一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're happy. They think they have a good bead on things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.09,0:31:41.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为何要保密呢? 人们很聪明 可以应付的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are smart. They can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.93,0:31:42.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人是聪明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A person is smart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.30,0:31:47.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,众人是愚蠢 易慌张 和危险的动物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are dumb, panicky, dangerous animals, and you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.43,0:31:50.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1500年前 每个都人知道...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}1500 years ago, everybody knew the Earth was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.81,0:31:52.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...地球是宇宙的中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the centre of the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.77,0:31:56.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,五百年前 每个人都知道地球是平的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}500 years ago, everybody knew the Earth was flat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.36,0:32:00.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,十五分钟前 你知道在地球上只有人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And 15 minutes ago, you knew that people were alone on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.49,0:32:04.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想想明天...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine what you'll know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.74,0:32:05.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你会知道什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.33,0:32:10.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有什么坏处? - 坏处? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the catch? - The catch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.12,0:32:13.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坏处就是你会切断 和人类的接触{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The catch is, you will sever all human contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.87,0:32:16.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没人知道你存在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody will ever know you exist anywhere...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.88,0:32:19.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.26,0:32:25.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让你考虑到日出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you to sunrise to think it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.89,0:32:32.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,值得吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it worth it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.48,0:32:33.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是值得的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, it's worth it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.36,0:32:37.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...若你够坚强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're strong enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.21,0:33:39.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, pops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.18,0:33:51.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我要加入...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.35,0:33:54.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...因为这儿有更深层的事 会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...because there's some next-level shit going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.89,0:33:58.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但首先我要你明白某些事情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before y'all beam me up, there's a few things to understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.40,0:34:02.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,首先 是你选我...你知道我的长处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}First off, you chose me, so you recognize the skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:06.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想人叫我为小子 明白吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want nobody calling me "son" or " kid" or "sport." Cool?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.28,0:34:07.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随便 油嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool. Whatever, slick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.74,0:34:10.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但我要告诉你关于你的长处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I need to tell you something about all your skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你看到的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of right now, they mean precisely...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.20,0:34:15.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你看到的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}As of right now, they mean precisely...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.95,0:34:17.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...这些家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.47,0:34:32.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 此行的目的? - 外交任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Purpose of trip? - Diplomatic mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.22,0:34:34.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停留时间? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Duration of stay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.39,0:34:35.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃午餐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.93,0:34:37.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有水果或蔬菜吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any fruits or vegetables?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.28,0:34:52.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要远离那家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna stay away from that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.95,0:34:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它脾气很坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's grouchy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.79,0:34:58.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在旅行了17兆里后又在海关 滞留三小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three hours in customs after a 17-trillion-mile trip...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.96,0:35:00.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都会让人脾气暴躁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...will make anyone cranky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.67,0:35:02.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们向政府哪部门报告? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What government branch do we report to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.83,0:35:05.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没有 他们有太多问题 - 谁支付这一切? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- None. They ask too many questions. - Who pays for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.63,0:35:10.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们拥有几项仪器的专利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hold patents on a few gadgets we confiscated from out-of-state visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.34,0:35:12.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,魔术帖 微波炉 抽脂手术{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Velcro, microwave ovens, liposuction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.72,0:35:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这装置很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a fascinating gadget.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.14,0:35:16.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不久就能取代CD {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll replace CDs soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.13,0:35:18.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那样我就又能买《白色相簿》了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} I'll have to buy the White Album again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.93,0:35:23.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这很好玩 是宇宙翻译机 我们不该有的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fun. A universal translator. We're not even supposed to have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.31,0:35:25.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人的思想原始得...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human thought is so primitive. It's looked upon...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.15,0:35:28.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...在别的星河认为是 会传染的疾病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...as an infectious disease in some galaxies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.94,0:35:30.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这会使你引以为荣的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That kind of makes you proud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.03,0:35:32.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么东西? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.95,0:35:37.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be calm!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.45,0:35:38.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别慌张! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.20,0:35:40.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心你的头! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch your head!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.04,0:35:42.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他点冰吧! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone get him some ice!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.58,0:35:46.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,走开! 它向你飞来时快走开! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out! Move! Just move when it's coming at you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.93,0:35:53.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.51,0:35:56.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会赔偿的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pay for that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.40,0:36:10.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它在1977年导致纽约大停电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing caused the 1977 New York blackout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.49,0:36:13.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是大吸引者的玩笑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Practical joke by the Great Attractor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.86,0:36:15.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他认为很有趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thought it was funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.87,0:36:18.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 抱歉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, y'all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.83,0:36:20.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是意外 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a accident. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.50,0:36:23.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,观察室 我们工作的中心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Observation, the heart of our endeavour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.83,0:36:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来介绍一下 双胞胎 波和卜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meet the twins, Blblup and Bob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.25,0:36:29.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这地图显示地球上 每个外星人的所在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This map shows the location of every alien on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.84,0:36:31.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些会一直被监视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some are under constant surveillance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.22,0:36:34.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,荧幕上的全是外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone on those screens is an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.55,0:36:37.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在公众场合他们很正常 但在私底下...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In public, they're as normal as you are, but in private...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.01,0:36:39.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll get the idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.22,0:36:41.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.06,0:36:43.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不合理 是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't make any sense, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.89,0:36:47.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 合情合理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, no, it makes perfect sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.11,0:36:51.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我三年级时 人人都以为我疯了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In third grade, everyone said I was crazy, but I knew our teacher...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:53.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但我知道老师 一定是金星来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...had to be from Venus or something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:56.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,魏太太其实来自木星的... {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ms. Edelson. Jupiter, actually. Well, one of the moons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.24,0:36:59.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其中之一月球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...revolve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.37,0:37:00.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,各位...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Class...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.16,0:37:03.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...安静并请注意! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...be quiet and pay attention!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.50,0:37:06.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若我要再{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I have to tell you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.33,0:37:08.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说一次...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...one more time...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.42,0:37:11.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,穿上吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's put it on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.46,0:37:13.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,穿什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put what on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.92,0:37:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你穿的最后一套衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last suit you'll ever wear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.94,0:37:31.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只能穿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will dress only in attire specially sanctioned...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.90,0:37:33.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...黑超特警特定的服装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}... by MiB Special Services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.40,0:37:37.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要依照我们给你的身分...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll conform to the identity we give you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.45,0:37:40.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...到指定地方吃饭 到指定地方居住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}... eat where we tell you, live where we tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.87,0:37:41.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在开始...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}From now on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.08,0:37:44.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你没有任何的身分记号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}... you'll have no identifying marks of any kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.83,0:37:47.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你绝不能突出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not stand out in any way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.87,0:37:49.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你整体的形象被塑造成...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your entire image is crafted...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.00,0:37:52.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...不能留给所遇上的人 任何印象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}... to leave no lasting memory with anyone you meet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.25,0:37:55.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谣言...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a rumour, recognizable only as...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.88,0:37:58.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...对人家来说只是似曾相似 又不认得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}... deja vu and dismissed\njust as quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.01,0:38:01.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不存在 甚至没有出生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't exist. You were never born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:06.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的名字是无名氏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anonymity is your name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.31,0:38:08.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不作声是你的语言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silence, your native tongue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.98,0:38:11.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不再是制度一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're no longer part of the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.48,0:38:13.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在制度之上 之外 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are above the system. Over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.15,0:38:15.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,超越了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beyond it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.86,0:38:19.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're "them. " We're "they. "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.41,0:38:21.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是黑超特警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are the Men in Black.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.21,0:38:32.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我和你的分别就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what the difference is between you and me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.84,0:38:36.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我穿起来更好看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make this look good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.97,0:38:40.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你和我开车去走走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna go for a little ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.34,0:38:45.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我先把你放下 爸爸很快回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll put you down here for a minute, and Daddy will be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.46,0:39:19.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我们可以起程了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, now we're ready to go for a little ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.59,0:39:23.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去见爸爸的朋友 你会很喜欢他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll meet one of Daddy's friends, and you'll like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.22,0:39:28.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我们看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.85,0:39:32.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...被罢免的主管...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bee, we got the deposed sur-prefect of Singalee...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.56,0:39:35.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...今晚在波兰外降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...touching down in the forest outside Portland tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.73,0:39:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 类似人类的? - 你想的美 带着海绵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Humanoid? - You wish. Bring a sponge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.57,0:39:41.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是昨晚留下的红色警告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Red letter from last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.36,0:39:45.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,纽约上州有未经批准的降落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had an unauthorized landing in upstate New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.57,0:39:47.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 留意此事发展{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your ears open on this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.78,0:39:51.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是主持星际派对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not hosting an intergalactic kegger down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.08,0:39:54.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a skimmer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:56.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,移民来的外星人越区 是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Landed alien out of zone. Who is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.09,0:39:58.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,烈擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Redgick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.38,0:40:01.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不能离开曼哈顿...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not cleared to leave Manhattan, but he's out of town...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.63,0:40:03.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但他现时离城 被堵在公路上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...stuck on the New Jersey turnpike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.93,0:40:05.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不带小子去? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take junior with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.89,0:40:08.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这对他来说是热身的好机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a good one for him to warm up on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.26,0:40:10.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去对付他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get him, tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.23,0:40:19.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"我们不是主持星际派对"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"We're not hosting an intergalactic kegger."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.40,0:40:24.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.16,0:40:30.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全宇宙有无限的科技 而我们却利用这烂车...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlimited technology from the whole universe, and we cruise around...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.33,0:40:31.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...来做交通工具{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a Ford POS.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.33,0:40:36.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,绑好安全带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fasten your seat belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.42,0:40:38.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的人际关系还要加强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta work on your people skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.50,0:40:41.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若你礼貌一点 所得的反应会较好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd get a better reaction if you were polite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.46,0:40:43.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请绑好安全带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fasten your seat belt, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.30,0:40:44.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 你有受伤吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Did you hurt yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.76,0:40:52.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你千万别碰那红色按钮 小子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The red button there, kid. Don't ever touch the red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.44,0:41:05.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 老爹 七十二元{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, pop, that'll be $72 there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.74,0:41:08.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 宝贝 让我付钱给无礼的司机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sweetie, let me pay the impolite driver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.73,0:41:42.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉我迟到了 这星球的司机很差{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.23,0:41:45.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,陛下 你很危险{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.86,0:41:48.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 而且每次都 多收车资{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.11,0:41:52.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个虫降落了 我们要把你从这星球送走{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.20,0:41:55.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个昆虫? 他一定知道我为何会在这{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.66,0:41:57.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们想他是知道的{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.71,0:42:00.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我所想要的吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.71,0:42:03.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 只是给你孩子的 钻石{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.46,0:42:04.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有空进食吗?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.46,0:42:08.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 我已替你点了菜{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.05,0:42:13.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,六号上菜! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six is up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.89,0:42:15.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,艾文呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is lvan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.18,0:42:17.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我让他休息了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gave him a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.36,0:42:31.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为亚基伦帝国 继续统治干杯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.66,0:42:33.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为银河系安全干杯{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.92,0:42:43.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以杀我们 但你找不到银河系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can kill us both, but you will not find the Galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.92,0:42:47.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说对一件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right about one thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.48,0:43:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你哪里也不能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not going anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.12,0:43:22.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请出示执照及登记证书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your licence and registration, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.00,0:43:29.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请出示另外那种执照及登记证书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like to see your other licence and registration, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.14,0:43:39.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你只限在曼哈顿活动 你去哪儿 烈擎? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're restricted to Manhattan. Where are you going, Redgie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.77,0:43:43.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我太太 她... 看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my wife. She's... Well, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.11,0:43:49.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问题不大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.53,0:43:51.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 你跟我来 烈擎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you come with me, Redge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.82,0:43:55.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你应付这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.16,0:43:57.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? 我? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?! Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.78,0:44:00.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你只要接就好了 - 他知道他在做什么吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You just catch. - Does he know what he's doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.37,0:44:02.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 让他做吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He does it all the time. Let him work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.17,0:44:12.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哎哟 老天! 所以...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.76,0:44:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有东西伸出来了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's peeking!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.68,0:44:18.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你却先往城外去 到底什么事? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're headed out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.89,0:44:21.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们去见别人 - 是谁? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're meeting someone. - Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.43,0:44:24.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是一艘船 - 我今天没有看到有核准离境的资料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a ship. - I saw no departure clearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.69,0:44:25.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.81,0:44:28.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是紧急事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an emergency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.65,0:44:29.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你做得很好 好样的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're doing fine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.19,0:44:34.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么紧急事? 为何突然要离开星球? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of emergency? What's the rush to get off the planet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.65,0:44:36.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是不喜欢 我们的那一区了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't like the neighbourhood anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.07,0:44:38.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有些是新来的人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of the new arrivals...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.16,0:44:42.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,新来的? 和昨晚坠毁的有关吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}New arrivals? Have anything to do with the crasher last night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.70,0:44:44.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 小姐! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, miss!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.75,0:44:49.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.79,0:44:51.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.55,0:44:54.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.72,0:44:56.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.05,0:45:00.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜 烈擎 它是个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations, Redge. It's a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.10,0:45:02.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...乌贼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...squid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.85,0:45:06.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他其实是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.77,0:45:09.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...非常的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...actually kind of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.03,0:45:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...可爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.08,0:45:27.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚才有什么不正常的地方? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything about that seem unusual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.88,0:45:31.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么把他吓成这样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would scare Redgick so badly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.71,0:45:34.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...要带着新生儿去冒险? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that he'd risk a warp jump with a newborn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.63,0:45:36.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们追查资料吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll check the hot sheets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.18,0:45:43.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,教宗是个父亲 令人震惊的证据在内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are "hot sheets"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.60,0:45:45.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是资料? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best investigative reporting on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.89,0:45:48.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,地球上最佳的调查报告{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Read The New York Times if you want. They get lucky sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.35,0:45:53.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想不到你在超市卖的 八卦报导上找线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cannot believe you're looking for tips in the supermarket tabloids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.57,0:45:56.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是在找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not " looking for."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.94,0:45:59.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,, 找到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.00,0:46:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.00,0:46:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.61,0:46:01.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(外星人偷走了我丈夫的皮囊)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.33,0:46:14.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 慢着 别急  - 为什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait a minute, slow down. - Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.96,0:46:18.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给她点时间让她想歪了 让调查更容易些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give her time to get the wrong impression. Makes it smoother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.30,0:46:20.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有何贵干? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.97,0:46:24.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是联邦调查局的文特警 他是毕特警{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, ma'am. I'm Agent Manheim, this is Agent Black, FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.51,0:46:26.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想问有关访客的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'd like to talk about your visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.47,0:46:27.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们也要拿我开玩笑? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna make fun of me too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.14,0:46:30.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,调查局的人没有可令人察觉的 幽默感 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, we do not have a sense of humour we're aware of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.91,0:46:32.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以进来吗?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}May we come in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.98,0:46:34.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请进{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.32,0:46:36.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 谢谢 - 要柠檬水吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Thank you. - Lemonade?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.78,0:46:38.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yes, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.82,0:46:45.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警察局长亲自来这...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chief of police came to the house...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.49,0:46:47.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...做了一个全面的调查{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and did an investigation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.95,0:46:51.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拿走警方报告 还写下我说的一切...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took a police report and writ down everything I said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.33,0:46:53.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但不相信我说的 任何一句话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...not believing one thing I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.38,0:46:55.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且还有点在取笑我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sort of poking fun at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.34,0:46:57.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们问我 若他被谋杀...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He asked me, " If he was murdered...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.67,0:47:00.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...怎么能走进屋子? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...how was he able to walk back in the house?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.34,0:47:03.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我得承认这把我问倒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta admit to you that that one got me stumped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.59,0:47:06.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我了解雅加 那人不是雅加{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tell you, I know Edgar, and that wasn't Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.68,0:47:10.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像有东西在穿雅加的身体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like something was wearing Edgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.64,0:47:13.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像是外衣...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a suit...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.52,0:47:15.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...一件"雅加"外衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...an Edgar suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.53,0:47:26.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那人变外星人前已很丑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude was that ugly before he was an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.16,0:47:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.37,0:47:32.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.42,0:47:34.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.83,0:47:36.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我醒来他己离去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I come to and he's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.92,0:47:38.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说了什么吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He say anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.21,0:47:42.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有 他向我要水喝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. He asked me for some water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.67,0:47:44.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糖水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some sugar water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.88,0:47:45.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糖水? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sugar water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.22,0:47:49.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得 因为很怪异...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember that right. I thought that that was odd...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.60,0:47:53.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...他要糖水而不是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...that he asked me for sugar water and not lemonade or ice water...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.10,0:47:55.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...水或自来水...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or regular water...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.60,0:47:56.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...水或冰水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...tap water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.94,0:48:00.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 碧姿 没有外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Beatrice. There was no alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.86,0:48:03.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那道闪光不是飞碟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The flash of light was not a U.F.O.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.40,0:48:07.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是上升煤气团被金星反射{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gas was trapped in a thermal pocket and refracted the light from Venus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.95,0:48:09.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.45,0:48:12.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你洗掉她记忆再编个新的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing erases her memory, and you just make up a new one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.12,0:48:14.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是记忆清除器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A standard-issue neuralizer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.00,0:48:17.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你编那么烂的故事? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That weak-ass story is the best you came up with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.04,0:48:20.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 附加说明...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. On a more personal note...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.84,0:48:22.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...雅加跟他前任女友跑了 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Edgar ran off with an old girlfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.99,0:48:24.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你搬去跟你妈住一阵就好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll stay with your mama...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.09,0:48:26.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这样会更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and decide you're better off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.72,0:48:30.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,反正他对你那么坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, because he never appreciated you anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.97,0:48:32.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.14,0:48:35.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是你甩了他 他走了...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kicked him out. And now that he's gone...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.10,0:48:39.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你可以买漂亮衣服{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you'll go in town, find yourself some nice dresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.48,0:48:43.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,买双鞋 也许去做面部按摩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get yourself some shoes. Find somewhere you could get a facial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.11,0:48:48.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而且...快找人来重新装修 这儿很不济{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And hire a decorator to come in here quick because... damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.54,0:48:58.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我何时才能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do I get my own flashy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.58,0:48:59.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...有记忆清除器? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...memory messer-upper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.21,0:49:01.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等你长大之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you grow up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.34,0:49:06.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托不要是绿色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Not green.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.80,0:49:08.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该死! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.51,0:49:13.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道哪种 外星人是流绿汁...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know which alien leaves a green spectral trail...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.60,0:49:14.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...喝糖水的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and craves sugar water?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.93,0:49:19.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是昨晚机智问答的题目 答案是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was on Jeopardy last night. Damn, Alex said it was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.02,0:49:21.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,Z 虫族入侵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zed, we have a bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.57,0:49:25.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,意思是... 我们不喜欢虫族? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So... What? We don't like bugs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.57,0:49:27.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虫族制造大屠杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bugs thrive on carnage, tiger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.20,0:49:32.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们消耗 骚扰其他种族...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They consume, infest, destroy, live off the death of other species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.78,0:49:34.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你童年时被虫咬过? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were stung as a child, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.45,0:49:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想像一个超大蟑螂 它力大无穷...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine a giant cockroach with unlimited strength...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.33,0:49:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...劣等生物本性 易怒...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...a massive inferiority complex, and a real short temper...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.13,0:49:46.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...穿雅加的皮横行曼哈顿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is terrorizing Manhattan Island in a new Edgar suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.59,0:49:48.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来有趣吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That sound like fun?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.14,0:49:52.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么做? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.39,0:49:55.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只要虫族在城里 我们就要去殓房监视{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a bug in town, we'll watch the morgues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.19,0:50:10.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,3号尸体要放哪里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you want contestant number 3?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.24,0:50:11.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放在那就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just leave it there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.99,0:50:13.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那只猫怎么回事? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the cat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.32,0:50:16.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫有个麻烦 在这签名{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a problem with the cat. Sign here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.62,0:50:19.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 什么麻烦? - 你的麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the problem with the cat? - It's your problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.75,0:50:24.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌活人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate the living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.30,0:50:27.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.33,0:50:59.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 我的老天! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.29,0:51:05.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,朋友 你是什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy, what are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.68,0:51:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,解剖时尸温约112华氏度...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subject was approximately 112 degrees at time of autopsy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.18,0:51:19.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...表示体温上升了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...indicating a temperature increase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.60,0:51:23.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,验尸者想由直肠量体温 却找不到直肠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Examiner tried to verify this rectally, but the subject had no rectum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.98,0:51:25.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这情况真...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is really...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.65,0:51:26.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.40,0:51:31.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是卫生署的文医生 与白医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Dr. Leo Manville, Department of Public Health. This is Dr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.61,0:51:34.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们一定没有家庭生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must not have a home life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.86,0:51:38.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们最近在监视这殓房 近来有何异常状况? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We watch the morgues carefully. You have something unusual?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.37,0:51:40.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有 三重凶杀案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say so. Triple homicide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.91,0:51:42.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一个还算正常 除了被折成两半之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first body was normal, except he was broken in half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.79,0:51:44.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一个还算正常 除了被折成两半之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first body was normal, except he was broken in half.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.33,0:51:46.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当我解剖了另两个尸体...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when I opened up the other two, well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.08,0:51:48.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我带你去看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.97,0:51:58.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他的骨骼架构有异于常人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a skeletal structure unlike anything I've seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.35,0:51:59.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我查看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll have a look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.01,0:52:02.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们去查看另一个尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Dr. Weaver check the other body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.43,0:52:03.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往这边走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.52,0:52:06.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个更怪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This one's even stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.31,0:52:09.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做腹部解剖 我由胃开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did a laparotomy. I started with the stomach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.23,0:52:13.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以由食道开始 或看你想从哪里开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can start with the gastroesophageal junction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.82,0:52:17.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就照你的方法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's start wherever you started at.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.20,0:52:19.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okey-dokey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.25,0:52:29.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是你的猫? - 现在是了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is this your cat? - It is now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.04,0:52:32.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟着尸体来的 探手进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came in with the body. Dive right in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.63,0:52:34.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他不会在意的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure he won't mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.97,0:52:39.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼神很迷人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have really pretty eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.85,0:52:41.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.68,0:52:46.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉到了吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.81,0:52:49.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,摸到幽门了? 推过一旁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the pyloric junction would be? Push it aside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.36,0:52:53.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么不对? 胃 肝 肺...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notice anything strange? Stomach, liver, lungs...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.78,0:52:55.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 都很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope, all fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.90,0:52:57.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,器官都不见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.16,0:52:59.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.28,0:53:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我首先便注意到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's obviously the first thing I noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.78,0:53:05.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是说 里面没有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I was pointing out is the fact that there are no...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.96,0:53:08.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...碎片...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...pieces...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.54,0:53:10.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...of them left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.29,0:53:13.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 那些器官都...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, so they're intact...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.80,0:53:16.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是完整的不见了... ...是肯定的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wherever they are whole. That we can be sure of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.13,0:53:18.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们见过吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we met before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.38,0:53:21.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个似曾相识的感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having a feeling of dejavu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.97,0:53:25.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我也是 - 真的? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, me too. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.10,0:53:28.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,想知道我在想什么吗? 但别告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna know what I think? Don't tell him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.81,0:53:32.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他太紧张了 我认为那不是尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's under enough stress. I don't think it's a real body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.40,0:53:35.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我认为这是种运输工具 或是类似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's some kind of transport unit for something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.98,0:53:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问题是 什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The question is, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.70,0:53:40.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是不是把你吓坏了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this freaking you out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.24,0:53:44.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.04,0:53:49.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道有时候我想做什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I like to do sometimes when it's late?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.33,0:53:52.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.34,0:53:54.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白医生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. White.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.42,0:53:57.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.47,0:54:03.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎样? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.18,0:54:07.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣 她很喜欢死人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting. She got a "Queen of the Undead" thing going...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.64,0:54:08.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是指"身体"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of the body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.14,0:54:09.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,身材很劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.19,0:54:11.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我指尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dead body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.69,0:54:14.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你最好去看看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to look at that thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.98,0:54:16.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,认得他吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You recognize him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.11,0:54:20.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在总部见过他 只是更死像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looks like the big guy I saw at headquarters, only deader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.86,0:54:22.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是什么杀了他? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What killed him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.49,0:54:24.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虫族? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bug?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.33,0:54:26.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她在叫你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're up, slugger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.66,0:54:31.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.67,0:54:35.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.65,0:54:55.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,必须...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.73,0:54:58.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,避免...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To prevent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.15,0:55:03.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...争夺{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...contest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.11,0:55:05.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想说什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.82,0:55:07.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,避免...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To prevent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.49,0:55:08.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,避免...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To prevent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.29,0:55:10.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...挣扎? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...struggle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.75,0:55:13.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...避免...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To prevent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.33,0:55:15.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}War?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.63,0:55:16.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}War.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.42,0:55:20.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银河系...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Galaxy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.34,0:55:24.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...是在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.51,0:55:26.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...猎户座的...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Orion's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.93,0:55:29.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...带...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...be...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.68,0:55:34.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is word?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.77,0:55:36.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,床? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.60,0:55:38.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带? 猎户座星带? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Belt? Orion's belt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.88,0:56:02.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"避免战争 银河系在猎户座星带上"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To prevent war, the Galaxy is on Orion's belt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.51,0:56:04.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.89,0:56:09.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个叫...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.60,0:56:10.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...什么的 过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...whatever, come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.18,0:56:15.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫什么的? 你们不是卫生署派来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Whatever? You guys aren't really from the Department of Health.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.48,0:56:17.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛辛保! 可恶! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosenberg. Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.56,0:56:21.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚基伦人不会喜欢这个 他是皇族的成员之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arquillians won't like this. He was one of the royal family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.19,0:56:23.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是外星人...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an alien...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.61,0:56:26.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你们是政府官员 来掩饰实情的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and you're from a government agency keeping it under wraps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.16,0:56:30.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说避免战争 银河系在猎户座星带上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, "To prevent war, the Galaxy is on Orion's belt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.66,0:56:32.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了 你要怎么解释纽约? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How else do you explain New York?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.08,0:56:35.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在计程车 这个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in this cab, and this guy was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.33,0:56:39.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银河系在猎户座星带上 听起来没道理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Galaxy on Orion's belt" makes no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.67,0:56:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大头里的小人是这么说 对吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what the little dude inside the big dude's head said, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.84,0:56:46.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可恶! 你洗掉了她的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, man! You did the flashy thing already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.05,0:56:49.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不论你们是谁 出示身份证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever you are, you'll have to show me I.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.89,0:56:52.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 小姐 请看一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, young lady. Look at this for me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.18,0:56:55.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 别再闪了 好吗？- 怎么了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you stop that? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.22,0:56:57.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那个会害她得脑癌的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing will give her brain cancer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.60,0:56:59.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她没被伤害过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never hurt her before. Close the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.10,0:57:01.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,, 特勤组快到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Special Services will be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.15,0:57:05.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你闪了那可怜的女人几次? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many times have you flashy-thinged that woman?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.28,0:57:06.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.36,0:57:09.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不担心造成长期影响? - 有一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't you worry about long-term damage? - A little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.86,0:57:11.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你闪过我吗? - 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have you flashy-thinged me? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.03,0:57:14.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的! 有没有闪过我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ain't playing with you! Have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.13,0:57:27.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,以后清除记忆的事交给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I should be in charge of the flashy thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.42,0:57:28.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有我在休想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not while I'm around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.09,0:57:31.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你会烧坏别人的脑袋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll fricassee someone's brain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.55,0:57:35.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有两个死了的外星人而且 验尸官需要新记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got two dead aliens and a medical examiner needs a new memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.14,0:57:40.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给她个快乐的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it a happy memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.72,0:58:15.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它到底在哪里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.60,0:59:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 Z...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Zed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.60,0:59:04.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...这里的人都不睡觉? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't anybody ever get any sleep around here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.65,0:59:08.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,孪生子让我们守圣塔伦时间 那一天有37小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The twins keep us on Centurian time. It's a 37-hour day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.77,0:59:11.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过几个月就会习惯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it a few months. You'll get used to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.28,0:59:12.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者你会精神错乱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or have a psychotic episode.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.40,0:59:14.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是猎户座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's Orion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.74,0:59:17.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是北方天空最亮的星群{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a grouping of the brightest stars in the northern sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.99,0:59:20.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是猎户星带 - 那个小人就是这么说:{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here's Orion's belt. - The little guy said:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.83,0:59:24.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,"避免战争 银河系在猎户座星带"{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}"To prevent war, the Galaxy is on Orion's belt."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.41,0:59:26.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小子 猎户星带上没银河系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no galaxies on Orion's belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.92,0:59:30.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,星带就是这3颗星 银河系是很大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The belt is just these three stars. Galaxies are huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.84,0:59:34.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有几十亿颗星 你听错了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're made up of billions of stars. You heard wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.84,0:59:38.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,随你说 我知道我听到什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, whatever, I know what I heard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.42,1:00:16.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很漂亮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.22,1:00:27.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,糟老头的故事渐渐的显现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That grumpy guy's story's starting to come into focus a little bit here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.52,1:00:31.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,献花给外星人的人就是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you were the guy in that picture with the flowers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.69,1:00:36.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜她一直没收到花{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, I take it, she never got those flowers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.74,1:00:39.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她结婚了吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what, she ever get married or anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.82,1:00:43.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有人说 轰轰烈烈的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say it's better to have loved and lost...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.95,1:00:46.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...胜于没爱过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...than never to have loved at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.33,1:00:47.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你试试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.09,1:00:54.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.46,1:00:55.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都在离境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.17,1:01:00.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,刚逃走了12个人 烈擎打头阵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've had 12 jumps in the last hour. Redgick was just the first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.97,1:01:02.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们获悉什么 我们不知道的情报? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they know that we don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.01,1:01:04.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老鼠为何弃船而逃? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why does a rat desert a ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.76,1:01:08.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看4号卫星显示 质子热感应显像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me Lem Sat 4, please, with a proton induction thermoscan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.44,1:01:12.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 18号卫星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Okay. Lem Sat 18.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.82,1:01:16.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好 4000号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, 4000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.41,1:01:21.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是亚基伦战舰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Arquillian battle cruiser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.12,1:01:24.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,而亚基伦王子死在地球上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we've got a dead Arquillian prince.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.58,1:01:28.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说到这个恶棍...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speak of the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.12,1:01:30.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来他们气坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sound pissed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.29,1:01:31.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快翻译出来 快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Translate that. Step on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.13,1:01:35.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去洛辛保珠宝店搜一搜 看能找出什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to Rosenberg's jewellery store, and see what you can turn up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.59,1:01:42.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给他个武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give the kid a weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.69,1:01:55.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 原子4号枪 - 就是我要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Series 4 De-atomizer. - That's what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.15,1:01:57.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小蟋蟀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noisy Cricket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.94,1:02:01.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 不 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kay, no, no, come on, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.20,1:02:04.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿原子4号...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get a Series 4 De-atomizer...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.91,1:02:06.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...我拿小蟋蟀? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I get a little midget Cricket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.79,1:02:12.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉上一捏就碎了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel like I'm gonna break it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.13,1:02:59.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的卡车! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, this is my truck!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.51,1:03:03.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记得领车时跟他们说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make sure you tell them that down at the impound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.97,1:03:12.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.36,1:03:24.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谁闯入珠宝店却不偷珠宝? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who breaks into a jewellery store and leaves the jewels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.07,1:03:27.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要找的不是珠宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody not looking for jewellery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.49,1:03:31.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙真爱他的猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy had a serious crush on his cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.58,1:03:35.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伏下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.84,1:03:41.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,老天! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.76,1:03:45.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是他 是那个虫族! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him. That's the bug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.88,1:03:47.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,穿着雅加衣! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the Edgar suit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.95,1:04:11.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别在众目睽睽下开枪! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not discharge our weapons in view of the public!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.95,1:04:13.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没时间讨论这个! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ain't got time for this bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.16,1:04:16.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,外星人的战舰就要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a alien battle cruiser about to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.79,1:04:19.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,总有战舰 死光枪...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's always an alien battle cruiser or a death ray...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.92,1:04:22.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...或是银河黑死病入侵地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...or an intergalactic plague about to wipe out life on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.00,1:04:25.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类快乐过日子因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way people get on with their happy lives...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.13,1:04:28.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...他们并不知情! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is they do not know about it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.60,1:04:35.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心那只虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And don't worry about the bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.81,1:04:38.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他走不了 船在我们手上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not leaving town. We got his ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.03,1:04:48.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,派封锁队来...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a containment crew...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.24,1:04:49.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...到麦道格街{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}... on MacDougal Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.74,1:04:54.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,封锁是个好主意了 但外星人还在继续离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Containment may be a moot point. The exodus continues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.62,1:04:58.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就像是舞会结束了 最后走要的付帐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The party's over, and the last one to leave gets stuck with the check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.71,1:05:01.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,忘恩负义的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sorry little ingrates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.26,1:05:10.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那亚基伦战舰呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the Arquillians?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.18,1:05:14.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,翻出部分的讯息是:交出银河系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've translated part of the message: " Deliver the Galaxy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.85,1:05:18.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他们要得不多 不是吗? - 有更好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They don't want much, do they? - Oh, it gets better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.31,1:05:19.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们要我们负责{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They hold us responsible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.12,1:05:25.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(黑超特警交出银河系)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.74,1:05:30.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把死人放在哪里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you keep your dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.95,1:05:32.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have any dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.28,1:05:34.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.62,1:05:35.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.45,1:05:38.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在市殓房吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The city morgue?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.46,1:05:50.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那些3张1块钱 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's three for a dollar, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.47,1:05:54.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为金星的光反射在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was some light that refracted off of Venus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.68,1:05:56.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...沼泽气上...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...into some swamp gas...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.39,1:05:57.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...所以会...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and that's what made the...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.14,1:05:59.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 小子! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, kid!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.35,1:06:01.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,失陪 怎么了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.02,1:06:04.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚基伦人要银河系 不管那是什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Arquillians want the Galaxy, whatever that means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.90,1:06:06.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,需要精通银河系的专家帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need help, a professional...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.98,1:06:10.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...一个对星际政治有经验的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with years of experience in intergalactic politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.40,1:06:13.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,希望那家伙还没离城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope the little twerp hasn't skipped town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.45,1:06:17.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大家聚到这里...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you'll gather over here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.53,1:06:20.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,聚到这里 再近一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, move in closer. That's good. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.16,1:06:24.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,请大家看这里 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you look right here, I'd appreciate it. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.68,1:06:40.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,伪装真差 一看就是外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The worst disguise ever. He's definitely an alien.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.68,1:06:43.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不喜欢? 谁在乎啊! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't like it, you can kiss my furry butt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.14,1:06:45.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你忙吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Busy, Frank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.27,1:06:47.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉没空 我的太空船要开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't talk now. My flight's leaving in...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.65,1:06:48.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your paws off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.90,1:06:50.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,叫捕狗队来! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the pound!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.36,1:06:52.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狗欠我朋友钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dog owes my friend money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.69,1:06:54.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关于亚基伦和虫族 你知道什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arquillians and bugs, what do you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.53,1:06:55.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不知道 - 不知道? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing. - Not a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.70,1:07:01.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,停 停! 好! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, stop, stop it! Okay, okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.62,1:07:03.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛辛保不只是亚基伦人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosenberg wasn't a two-bit Arquillian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.00,1:07:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是银河系的管理人 他以为在地球会安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was the guardian of the Galaxy. He thought he'd be safe on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.58,1:07:08.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虫族有另外的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bug had other plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.75,1:07:12.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银河系是宇宙次原子能源 的最好来源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Galaxy is the best source for subatomic energy in the universe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.88,1:07:15.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若虫族取得 亚基伦人就完了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the bugs get it, kiss the Arquillians goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.88,1:07:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,问星带的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask about the belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.18,1:07:19.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他说银河系在猎户座星带上 是什么意思? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rosenberg mentioned Orion's belt. What did he mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.10,1:07:21.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 考倒我了 - 考倒你了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Beats me. - Beats you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.68,1:07:23.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别摇了! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.77,1:07:28.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他在练习腹语{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a ventriloquist act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.06,1:07:30.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银河系在这里! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Galaxy is here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.78,1:07:32.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.82,1:07:35.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银河系十亿颗星怎会在这里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A galaxy's millions of stars and planets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.65,1:07:38.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们什么时候才了解到 尺寸不是问题? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When will you learn that size doesn't matter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.62,1:07:41.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,重要的东西也可以很小{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If something's important, it doesn't mean it's not small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:42.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多小? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How small?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.20,1:07:45.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像弹珠或珠宝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The size of a marble or a jewel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.79,1:07:48.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我要在赶太空船之前走一走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me. I gotta be walked before my flight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.71,1:07:49.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.13,1:07:55.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银河系在这 不是在猎户座星带上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the Galaxy's here, it's not on Orion's belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.78,1:08:17.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你想引人注意...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you want attention...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.28,1:08:20.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,猎户座{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Orion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.32,1:08:22.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好听的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a pretty name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.62,1:08:24.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.63,1:09:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 很好 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, good, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.01,1:09:24.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你确定铃没坏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for making sure the bell works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.81,1:09:28.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,农夫 有什么事? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, Farmer John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.06,1:09:32.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有个人来这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man came in here earlier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.23,1:09:34.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dead man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.31,1:09:36.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,与我何干? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that means what to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.32,1:09:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的好友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a very dear friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.90,1:09:43.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有只动物跟他一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe he had an animal with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.24,1:09:46.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我送他的礼物 一只猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a gift I gave him. A pet cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.03,1:09:48.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说非常的重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means worlds to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.91,1:09:50.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to have it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.91,1:09:54.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要身份证... ...宠物拥有人证明...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll need picture I.D., proof of ownership of the cat...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.63,1:09:58.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...与死人亲属关系 的公证证明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...notarized proof of kinship with the deceased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.09,1:10:00.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.26,1:10:03.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,哪样? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.51,1:10:06.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.60,1:10:09.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.71,1:10:17.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.66,1:10:27.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 交给我就行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Kay, let me handle this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.16,1:10:30.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过是抓猫 不难的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we gotta do is get a cat. It's not that hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.12,1:10:35.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你进去 你又会对她闪个不停{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you go in there, you'll start flashing your brain ray in her face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.62,1:10:37.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,会害她得血癌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll wind up with leukemia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.54,1:10:41.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,医生不需要你把她学的都洗掉 我只要五分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The doctor don't need you flashing away her med-school classes. Five minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.63,1:10:42.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.47,1:10:46.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那只猫呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the animal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.76,1:10:48.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说了 不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.43,1:10:50.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去找{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's see if we can find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.15,1:10:57.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.53,1:11:07.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.08,1:11:13.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你好吗? - 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How you doing? - Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.87,1:11:16.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是弗莱迪警官 26支局来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Sergeant Friday from the 26th Precinct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.04,1:11:19.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有只猫跟尸体一起被送来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cat came in with a corpse the other day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.88,1:11:21.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 名牌上是写着猎户座 - 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- "Orion" on the nametag? - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.80,1:11:25.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这只猫...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this cat is a witness...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.01,1:11:28.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...是谋杀案...的证人 我要带它走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...in a murder case. I'll need to take him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.72,1:11:30.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道猫在哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where the cat is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.55,1:11:31.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.39,1:11:35.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但你可以带我跟你走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but maybe you could take me with you instead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.10,1:11:40.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还真主动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn, you do start fast, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.31,1:11:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的想跟你走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd really like to go with you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.44,1:11:43.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...就是现在! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.40,1:11:46.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And exactly why is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.08,1:11:56.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有东西要给你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to show you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.66,1:11:57.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,慢点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.87,1:12:01.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不可以这么快! - 你没搞明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Girl, don't hit the gas like that! - You don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.38,1:12:03.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要看这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really need to see this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.88,1:12:05.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会 只有一件事 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will. One thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.64,1:12:08.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我来驾车 这不是雄纠纠的任务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta drive. It's not some macho trip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.68,1:12:11.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在说这是我的习惯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just the way I get down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.23,1:12:24.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,色鬼 你没搞懂{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, stud, you're really not getting this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.07,1:12:28.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮助我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I need you to help me with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.12,1:12:40.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freeze it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.46,1:12:41.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真迟钝! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are thick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.75,1:12:42.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么会知道? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.09,1:12:44.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,说得还不够清楚? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I have to sing it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.59,1:12:46.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你像在勾引我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were like a drunk prom date.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.38,1:12:50.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真是的! 女人显示出性独立...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Typical. Anytime a woman shows even a hint of sexual independence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.47,1:12:51.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.51,1:12:52.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放开她 吃屎的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.55,1:12:54.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听好 猴仔...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, monkey-boy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.60,1:12:57.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...跟你比起来我们进化多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...l'm on the top rung of the evolutionary ladder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.06,1:12:59.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,所以闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So can it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.39,1:13:01.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我看你的脸 然后我会把你的病治好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me your face, and I'll cure your ills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.19,1:13:05.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,拔过苍蝇的翅膀吗? 想过苍蝇会报仇吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever pull wings off a fly? Care to see the fly get even?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.77,1:13:07.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你的船呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your ship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.44,1:13:10.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没太空船 已经被没收了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's what you call that trash we got locked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.61,1:13:12.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放下武器! - 休想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put your weapons down! - Won't happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.24,1:13:14.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.37,1:13:15.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会没关系? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is it okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.16,1:13:18.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说将会没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying it's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.50,1:13:20.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别太肯定 混球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bet on it, meat sack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.17,1:13:31.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放我走! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.69,1:13:43.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,进去! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.94,1:13:49.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带我去这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.48,1:13:50.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,休想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.78,1:13:52.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带我去! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.67,1:14:11.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他上了计程车{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in a cab!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.99,1:14:36.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别动...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move! Don't move! Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.91,1:14:38.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 这位先生 什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.63,1:14:52.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搭计程车逃不出地球 走! 跟我来! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not leaving the planet in a cab. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.43,1:15:00.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,启动曼哈顿侦测网{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put up a bionet all the way around Manhattan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.35,1:15:02.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是人类就别想离开! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's not human, it doesn't leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.02,1:15:05.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚基伦战舰怎么说? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we hear from upstairs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.85,1:15:07.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一样 交出银河系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}" Deliver the Galaxy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.31,1:15:10.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虫族拿走银河系 但我们有他的船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bug's got the Galaxy, but we got his ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.48,1:15:15.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警告! 质子武器威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning: Plutonic fusion detection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.91,1:15:19.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,质子武器开动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning: Plutonic fusion detection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.95,1:15:26.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么开枪打我们? - 亚基伦战争规则 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are they shooting at us? - Battle rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.75,1:15:29.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们下了最后通牒 然后示警弹 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get an ultimatum, a warning shot,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.09,1:15:31.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,之后要在银河1周时间回覆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&} then a galactic week to respond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.59,1:15:34.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,银河1周是多久? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A galactic week? How the hell long is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.38,1:15:35.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.84,1:15:37.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,1小时? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}One hour?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.55,1:15:38.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.97,1:15:45.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狗屎! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.39,1:15:49.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了不让虫族得手 亚基伦人会毁了它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}To keep the bugs from getting it, Arquillians will destroy that galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.60,1:15:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,和它所在的星球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}And whatever planet it's on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.23,1:15:54.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你指的是我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're talking about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.94,1:15:56.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很讨厌吧? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sucks, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.95,1:16:01.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搜索1百里以内的太空船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get the location of every interstellar vehicle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.95,1:16:04.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,搜过了 法兰克搭上最后一艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already did. Frank took the last ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.37,1:16:06.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 史尼登机场与史龙码头 - 走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sneden's Landing and Throg's Neck. - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.79,1:16:08.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 大西洋城 - 走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about Atlantic City? - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.83,1:16:10.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 巴瑞欧站? - 走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bayonne? - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.50,1:16:13.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有三里岛 - 走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's Three Mile Island. - Gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.29,1:16:15.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 史坦登岛! - 走了 谢天谢地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Staten Island? - Gone, thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.80,1:16:19.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时间紧迫虫人若离开...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're running out of time. If that bug gets off Earth, we're bug food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.93,1:16:21.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿! 老头! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, old guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.10,1:16:27.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那还能用吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do those still work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.20,1:16:45.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你跟我来 - 什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're coming with me. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.79,1:16:48.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,长途飞行 我要点心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long trip. I'll need a snack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.67,1:16:55.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要走隧道? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tunnel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.88,1:16:58.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 还有别条路到皇后区? - 隧道会塞车! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know a better way to Queens? - It'll be packed!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.05,1:17:02.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(皇后区隧道)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.19,1:17:13.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,记得红色按纽吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember the red button?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.11,1:17:15.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,按红色按纽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push the red button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.57,1:17:17.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,最好绑安全带{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put on a seat belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.45,1:17:33.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你太紧张了 年轻人放轻松{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're much too tense. You're young. Relax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.33,1:17:35.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,放轻松 享受工作上的乐趣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take some joy in your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.33,1:17:36.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢音乐吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you like music?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.82,1:17:37.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(猫王)
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.09,1:17:40.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.67,1:17:41.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样好多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.37,1:18:14.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道猫王己死了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know Elvis is dead?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.21,1:18:17.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有 猫王没死 他回家了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Elvis is not dead. He just went home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.10,1:18:34.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想吃我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't wanna eat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.89,1:18:37.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是地球上的重要人物 我是皇后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm an important person on my planet. Like a queen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.90,1:18:40.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是女神 大家膜拜我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}A goddess, even. There are those who worship me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.98,1:18:42.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想让你知道 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trying to impress you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.99,1:18:45.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这样会引起战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just saying it could start a war!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.28,1:18:47.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争才好 我家人就有的吃的了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, war. That means more food for my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.07,1:18:51.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全部7千8百万的人 有许多张嘴要吃东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}All 78 million of them. That's a lot of mouths to feed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.66,1:18:54.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个好爸爸 但我要留在这! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a wonderful dad, but I'm staying here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.93,1:19:18.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是我的意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, that's what I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.35,1:19:21.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蟑螂来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roaches check in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.23,1:19:24.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,休想离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't check out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.28,1:19:33.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警告! 地球8分钟后毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning: E ight minutes to the destruction of Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.12,1:19:36.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,8分钟后...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}E ight minutes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.66,1:19:37.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...毁灭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}... to destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.13,1:20:25.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们用内爆第五级电波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll use pulsar level five with an implosion factor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.21,1:20:27.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? ! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.26,1:20:30.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,数到三就射击 一...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just shoot the damn thing on the count of three. One...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.72,1:20:31.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...二...三{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Two ...Three{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.65,1:21:34.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白痴! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You idiots!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.49,1:21:37.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不懂! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.53,1:21:38.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我赢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've won.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.96,1:21:40.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.50,1:21:43.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃奶的蠢货! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're milk-suckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.04,1:21:45.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.00,1:21:48.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,几秒钟后你们都不会碍事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a few seconds, you won't even be matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.71,1:21:51.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你因违反星际法被捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're under arrest for violating the Tycho Treaty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.67,1:21:54.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,交出你手上的银河系...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}So hand over whatever galaxy you might be carrying...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.68,1:21:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...然后把手放到头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and put your hands on your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.39,1:22:04.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我把手...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll put my hands...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.73,1:22:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...放到头上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...on my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.40,1:22:13.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像这样? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.72,1:22:44.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不在我的计划中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That did not go the way I planned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.06,1:22:46.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要让它上第二条船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him on the second ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.98,1:22:49.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说什么? - 别让他离开地球! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you talking about? - Keep him on this planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.15,1:22:52.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.73,1:22:54.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去拿回我的枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get my gun back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.41,1:22:58.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,喂 虫人! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, bug!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.49,1:23:01.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说话! 知道我用报纸杀过 {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how many of your kind I've swatted with a paper?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.66,1:23:04.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多少像你一样的虫子? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just a smear on the sports page...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.41,1:23:07.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你这个黏哒哒的 专吃内脏的寄生虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you slimy, gut-sucking, intestinal parasite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.83,1:23:09.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃我! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.46,1:23:10.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃我! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eat me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.10,1:23:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.60,1:23:33.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吃完就想逃? 不吃甜品了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just gonna eat and run? What about dessert?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.78,1:23:41.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.62,1:23:45.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪? 现在好戏才刚要上场! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going? This party's just getting started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.83,1:23:47.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.16,1:23:49.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.04,1:23:52.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,听好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.38,1:23:55.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个方法离开这星球 就是必须经过我这关{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one way off this planet, and that's through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.38,1:24:40.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪里? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.72,1:24:43.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你赢了? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why you running, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.68,1:24:45.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还站着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still standing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.06,1:24:48.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快 拿来 拿来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, bring it. Bring it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.91,1:25:10.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 那是你的姑妈吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Was that your auntie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.58,1:25:14.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这表示这是你舅舅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means that's your uncle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.42,1:25:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们长得都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all look alike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.05,1:25:28.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.10,1:25:32.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大坏虫有颗脆弱的心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big, bad bug got a bit of a soft spot, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.27,1:25:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白的是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't understand why you gotta...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.61,1:25:41.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你为什么要带人来这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...come down here bringing all this ruckus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.32,1:25:44.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,制造混乱夺取银河系? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...snatching up galaxies and everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.28,1:25:48.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的态度是不找麻烦 就没麻烦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}My attitude is, don't start nothing, won't be nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.67,1:25:58.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快从我的面前消失 免得麻烦上身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ease up out of my face before something bad happens to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.42,1:26:01.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,太迟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.20,1:26:33.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉亚基伦人 我们拿到银河系了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell the Arquillians we have the Galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.87,1:26:35.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,知道了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it, friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.33,1:26:39.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要把枪拿回来 是吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going to get your gun back, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.71,1:26:41.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这把枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like this gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.92,1:26:46.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在里面鬼混 害的我一个人在忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you was in there playing around, I was doing all the work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.38,1:26:49.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我先用石头打他的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to bean him in the head with this big rock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.59,1:26:51.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,本来想用木板打他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna hit him with a 2-by-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.76,1:26:53.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它踢我 好痛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}He kicked me. It hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.60,1:26:56.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿起火来吓他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then I got to the fire. I was like that with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.60,1:26:59.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,工作第二天表现不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad for your second day of work, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.86,1:27:03.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我遇过最怪异的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}This definitely rates a 9.0 on my weird-shit-o-metre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.61,1:27:07.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你该看看在1968年 麦格逊人迁移时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should've been here for the Zeronion migration in 1968.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.99,1:27:12.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还没出生吧! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you weren't even alive in '68.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.29,1:27:20.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很有趣的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting job you guys have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.06,1:27:38.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有规矩...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know we got these rules...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.14,1:27:41.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...但她协助我们杀了那只虫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...but she did help us bust that bug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.65,1:27:44.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许不必清除她的记忆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we didn't have to flashy-thing her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.98,1:27:49.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她会跟谁说? 她成天跟死人为伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Who will she tell? She hang out with dead people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.45,1:27:51.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是给她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.32,1:27:52.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是给我的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.33,1:27:55.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.87,1:27:59.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很美吧? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aren't they beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.87,1:28:01.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,星星{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.33,1:28:05.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很久没观赏 其实它们很...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never look at them anymore, but they actually are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.13,1:28:09.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...迷人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.18,1:28:16.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你把你的伙伴吓坏了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kay, you're frightening your partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.81,1:28:19.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我在训练接班人 不是拍档{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been training a replacement, not a partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.98,1:28:22.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,K 等一下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, Kay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.10,1:28:25.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一人无法胜任{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot do this job by myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.61,1:28:28.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两位! 我的寓所离这里很远{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, my apartment isn't anywhere near here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.48,1:28:30.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,甚至不在这个岛上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not even on the same island.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.03,1:28:33.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,日期...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Days...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.24,1:28:34.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...月份...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...months...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.70,1:28:35.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...年份{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.20,1:28:37.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要朝着自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always face it forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.55,1:28:50.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚从蟑螂肚里出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in an interstellar cockroach's gullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.47,1:28:52.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是100个最不愿记得的记忆之一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's one of 100 memories I don't want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.98,1:29:11.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.58,1:29:18.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}No...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.54,1:29:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...你不会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.66,1:29:28.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(底特律汽车向地心引力挑战)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.53,1:29:30.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(纽约棒球队 内野手说: 飞碟害我漏接)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.07,1:29:36.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,(一个男人昏迷35年后重回女友怀抱)
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.00,1:29:55.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 J{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey J,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.74,1:29:58.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,Z说索里领事要...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}The high consulate from Solaxium 9...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.16,1:30:01.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,...公牛队的票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}...wants seats for the Bulls game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.33,1:30:03.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,通知洛曼 他是索里星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call Dennis Rodman. He's from that planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.17,1:30:07.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,洛曼? 你在开玩笑吗? {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rodman? You're kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.08,1:30:09.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.71,1:30:11.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,并没有怎么掩饰嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs16\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much of a disguise.{\r}
